Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Permissions|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Documents And Media Portlet Reg Role
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPRolesCPDocumentsandmedia#ViewDocumentsAndMediaPortletRegRole|
	And Permissions set Up Reg Role Login User CP
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Permissions define Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DOCUMENTS_AND_MEDIA_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMPortlet view No Permission CP
	And Permissions remove Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_PAGES_SITE_PAGES_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_SITE_GO_TO_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Go to Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	Then Permissions remove Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DOCUMENTS_AND_MEDIA_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
